[ti:Paper Satellites]
[ar:Juniper Fold]
[length:02:20]
[by:MIFS demogen]

[00:22.86]Folded a rocket out of homework
[00:25.71]Taped a promise to its wing
[00:28.57]Threw it past the streetlight orbit
[00:31.43]Waited for the sky to ring
[00:32.96]
[00:45.71]Paper satellites
[00:47.14]Drifting over rooftops tonight
[00:50.00]Carry what I couldn't say
[00:52.86]Land it softly where you stay
[00:54.74]
[01:08.57]Kettle whistles in the kitchen
[01:11.43]Rain is writing on the glass
[01:14.29]Every little thing I send you
[01:17.14]Is a moment made to last
[01:18.78]
[01:31.43]Paper satellites
[01:32.86]Drifting over rooftops tonight
[01:35.71]Carry what I couldn't say
[01:38.57]Land it softly where you stay
